++/**
++ * \brief Set the white balance the grey pixel test is made with
++ * \param[in] gains The white balance gains of the frame
++ * \param[in] blackLevel The black level of the frame, 1.0 = full scale
++ *
++ * The statistics collect the pixels that look nearly grey with these gains
++ * separately, see SwIspStats::greySum_.
